      "message": "\"Unknown\" ?\n\nIf it\u0027s invalid I think we\u0027d want to throw. Now as we discussed offline, it\u0027s probably useful to ignore capabilities that we don\u0027t know about yet, so we can add more in the future and not force the dev to have separate config files depending on the SDK (assuming that\u0027s even possible, which I think it probably isn\u0027t)",
