      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, because this is always called in enforceNetworkRequestPermissions, this code will throw for any U+ app that calls `requestNetwork` but doesn\u0027t have the property. I don\u0027t think this is what we want. We only want to require the property if the request actually requests one of the relevant capability.",
